From 003b4cebd9c71732702a92daa7e2bbbad2cd543f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vaciller <wyc_19533480830@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 16:57:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: replace preinstall module with stage prebuilt
 scaffolding

    - ATK_DLRK3588.mk: include stage/preinstall.mk and register
      default-permissions for staged third-party APKs
    - stage/Android.mk: stage APKs as BUILD_PREBUILT into /system/preinstall
      for first-boot install
    - stage/preinstall.mk: list staged preinstall packages
    - default-permissions: add grants for AmapAuto, NeteaseCloudMusic,
      Ximalaya, Douyin, BilibiliHD, Emby, WallpaperEngine, AnExplorer
    - remove legacy preinstall Android.mk modules
---
